1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Líklega barnlaus! Prestur í Gufudal, Barðastrandasýsla. Hann er í sumum heimildum sagður hafa verið faðir Þorleifs, föður Marteins, föður Þorsteins, föður Þórðar, föður Barna-Sveinbjarnar, en engin haldbær rök finn
2 CONC ast fyrir þessari ætt færslu. Jón var veginn af Sigurði Ólafssyni og Ara Oddvakurssyni. Ari Oddvakursson var faðir óskilgetinnar dóttur Halldóru Þorgilsdóttur [sign Anna Pétursdóttir].
2 CONT
2 CONT He is thought to have been cildless! He was a priest in Gufudalur, Barðastrandarsýsla. He is in some sources said to have been the father of Þorleifur, father of Martin, father of Thorstein, father of Þórður, father of Sveinbjörn 
2 CONC “Children-Sveinbjörn”, but no good reasons are found for this family record. Jón “krókur” killed by Sigurður Ólafsson and Ari Oddvakursson. Ari Oddvakursson was the father of the illegitimate daughter of Halldora Þorgilsdóttir [si
2 CONC gn Anna Pétursdóttir].
