2 CONT From Wikipedia, the free encyclopedia
2 CONT
2 CONT Harald Kesja, Harald the Spear[1], (1080–1135) was the son of Eric I of Denmark. He was married to Ragnhild Magnusdotter, the daughter of King Magnus III of Norway.
