2 CONT =Could Arne Arnesson Lagi “The Short”, Giske be the same person as Arne Arnesson Giske, shown here as his father?=
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT * Son of Arne Arnesson Giske and Gjertrud Erlingsdatter på Sola 
2 CONT * [https://snl.no/Erling_Skjalgsson '''Through his mother Geirtrud, married to Torberg's brother Arne, he became the ancestor of the Bjarkøy family (see also Arnmødling family). Erling's male descendants, his son Aslak and his des
2 CONC cendants, lived as powerful chieftains on Sola for over 100 years after his death.''']
2 CONT
