2 CONT Brief Life History of Birna
2 CONT When Birna Aronsdóttir was born in 1079, in Selárdalur, Vestur-Barðastrandarsýsla, Westfjords, Iceland, her father, Aron Snorrasson, was 39 and her mother, Margrét Þórðardóttir, was 34. She married Bardur "Svarti" Atlason in 1099,
2 CONC  in Selárdalur, Vestur-Barðastrandarsýsla, Westfjords, Iceland. They were the parents of at least 12 sons and 5 daughters. She died in 1140, in her hometown, at the age of 61.
2 CONT
