1 NOTE EARL/JARL
1 NOTE He was a Jarl of Halland
1 NOTE He lived at Austrarr, Ørlandet, Norway. He fled Norway and was named Jarl in Halland, Sweden, by King Svein Estridsson of Denmark. He returned to Norway and was named a Lendmann by King Harald Hardråde. He was recorded as such in 
2 CONC 1027 and 1062.
