2 CONC pirators with "Halkel son of Jon Hallkelsson"[519].  King of the Øyskjegger in Norway 1192.  The Saga of King Sverre records that "Sigurd Kingsson" was killed in battle "in the water at Floruvoe" and was buried in "Marinkirk yard"
