1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ''' Myruna Maddadsdotter (Mýrún Maddaðardóttir)'''
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Hun bodde på Vestlandet, Island''' 
2 CONT
2 CONT * Myruna var datter til den irske kongen  Beadh-mac (Maddad) (Bjadmak) [Myruna was the daughter of the Irish king Beadh-mac (Maddad) (Bjadmak)]
2 CONT * Hun var gift med Audun den stamme, De hadde barna, Stein, Asbjørn, Svarthovde og Turid [She was married to Audun of? the tribe?  They had the children, Stein, Asbjørn, Svarthovde and Turid]
2 CONT
2 CONT Mýrún Maddaðardóttir Tilnavn / fordanskning: Myruna  Lokalitet: Vestl. Island Relationer: Datter af den irske kong Beadh-mac. Gift med Audun den stammende. Kilder: Landnamabogen: 71 [Myrun Maddaðardóttir Nickname / pre-Danish: Myr
2 CONC una Locality: Vestl. Iceland Relations: Daughter of the Irish King Beadh-mac. Married to Audun the Stuttering. Sources: Landnamabogen: 71]
2 CONT
2 CONT http://heimskringla.no/wiki/Landnamabogen
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT "31. kafli Auðun átti Mýrúnu, dóttur Maddaðar Írakonungs." 
2 CONT Landnámabók
2 CONT https://www.snerpa.is/net/snorri/landnama.htm
2 CONT
2 CONT Chapter 31 Auðun married Mýrúna, daughter of Maddad the King of Ireland / [an Irish king]?  [Sharon Doubell Jan 2022]
