2 CONC Snorre records the marriage of "King Eirik's daughter, Ragnhild" and "Arnfin, a son of Thorfin Hausakljufer" at the time the ex-king's sons left Orkney[832].  She married secondly her brother-in-law, Havard Jarl of Orkney.  Orkney
