2 CONT translated from https://is.wikipedia.org/wiki/%C3%9Eorvaldur_%C3%81svaldsson
2 CONT
2 CONT Thorvald Ásvaldsson was a settler in Hornstrandir. He and his son, Eric the Red were guilty of manslaughter on the periphery in Norway. They came to Iceland and took Þorvaldur land and lived on Drangar in Drangavik. After his deat
2 CONC h brought up Eric south Haukadal.
2 CONT
2 CONT Thorvald the son Ásvaldr, Oxen-Thorir.
