2 CONT
2 CONT BIRTH: 1133, Sørum, AK ? 
2 CONT
2 CONT DEATH: 10 Jun 1155, Bergen 
2 CONT
2 CONT Father: Harald IV Magnusson GILLE 
2 CONT
2 CONT Mother: Thora GUTTORMSDOTTER 
2 CONT
