2 CONT
2 CONT      Sigurd II Haraldsson, King of Norway was born in 1133.1 He was the son of Harald IV Magnusson, King of Norway and Ingirith Ragnvaldsdottir. (1) He married Christine Sigurdsdottir, daughter of Sigurd I Magnusson, King of Norwa
2 CONC y and Malmfried of Novgorod. (1) 
2 CONT
2 CONT He died in 1155, murdered. (1)
2 CONT
2 CONT      Sigurd II Haraldsson, King of Norway also went by the nick-name of Sigurd 'Mund' (or in English, Sigurd 'Mouth'). (2) He succeeded to the title of King Sigurd II of Norway in 1136. (1)
2 CONT
