2 CONT
2 CONT Sigurd married Ingeborg Guttormsdtr Norheim, daughter of Guttorm Ivarsson Norheim and Unknown, in 1310. (Ingeborg Guttormsdtr Norheim was born in 1280 in På Norheim.)
