1 NOTE {geni:about_me} It is Eyrbyggja Saga that says that Olaf the White was the son of Ingjald and Thora, the daughter of "Sigurd Snake-in-the-Eye". So perhaps she was married twice, but the Saga does not mention any other husband.
2 CONT
2 CONT It is assumed that other sources that show her married to Olaf Gerstead-Alf Gudrodson, King of Norway, is incorrect. This Olaf is the grandfather of the Ingjald that married Thora.
