2 CONT
2 CONT "19. EARL HAKON'S MARRIAGE.
2 CONT Earl Hakon married a girl called Thora, a daughter of the powerful Skage Skoptason, and very beautiful she was. They had two sons, Svein and Heming, and a daughter called Bergljot who was afterwards married to Einar Tambaskielfer.
