2 CONT Jon Kuvlung was born in 1150, the alleged son of King Inge I of Norway. He was a young cleric before former supporters of Magnus V of Norway proclaimed him King at Tonsberg in 1185. Jon ruled from Viken, rebelling against King Sve
2 CONC rre of Norway. In 1186, he attacked Nidaros and took Sverre by surprise, only to be killed in a failed attack on Bergen in 1188.
2 CONT
2 CONT ---
