2 CONC King of Leinster, (d. 972)? Annals of Tigernach 992: "Mór ingen Taidg maic Cathail maic Concobair, rigan Erenn, mortua est."1 Rígan Érenn Mór ingen Taidg Uí Conchobair died in 992.1
