2 CONC 79501493237?through=6000000002043186310 Conchobhar] son of Maeleachlainn king of Teamhair”[620].  It is assumed that Maelsechnaill separated from Gormlaith as he is recorded with another wife before Gormlaith died.  m firstly as h
2 CONC is third wife, [https://www.geni.com/people/Olaf-Sithricsson-King-of-Dublin-York/6000000003645985234?through=6000000002043182790 OLAF] Sihtricsson King of Dublin, son of [https://www.geni.com/people/Sitric-C%C3%A1ech-ua-%C3%8Dmair
