2 CONC , son of [https://www.geni.com/people/Cennetig-Mac-Lorcain-King-of-the-Dal-Gcais/6000000002043192241?through=6000000002043263223 CEINNÉITIG] & his wife --- (941-killed in battle Clontarf 23 Apr 1014).  m thirdly ([separated]) as h
2 CONC is [third] wife, '''[https://www.geni.com/people/Maelsechnaill-King-of-Ireland/6000000079501312352?through=6000000002043186310 MAELSECHNAILL] King of Ireland,''' son of [https://www.geni.com/people/Domnall/6000000079502203853?thro
