2 CONT
2 CONT YORKSHIRE, ENGLAND, ABT 1030-35.
2 CONT
2 CONT "LORD OF THE ISLES".
2 CONT
2 CONT ANCESTORS CAME FROM SCHLESWIG, IN DENMARK, AND SETTLED IN ANCIENT EBOR OR
2 CONT
