2 CONT >>>1.         '''[http://www.geni.com/people/Donnchad-mac-Ma%C3%ADl-Coluim/6000000003999583795  DUNCAN] ([1060/65]-murdered Monthechim/Mondynes, Kincardineshire 12 Nov 1094, bur Dunfermline Abbey, Fife).'''  William of Malmesbury 
