2 CONT http://trees.ancestry.com/rd?f=image&guid=b521e641-fb78-4323-b3fe-8c37533585ff&tid=8976248&pid=-762097935
1 NOTE Died an Infant
1 NOTE Malcolm III.
2 CONT Source:
2 CONT Stuart Roderick, W.
2 CONT Royalty for Commoners, 3rd Edit. Published, Genealogical Publishing Co, Inc. Baltomore, MD. 1998,
