2 CONT
2 CONT Later sources identify this Hrolf with Rollo of Normandy, an extremelydoubtful identification. It is unlikely that there was any closerelationship between the early dukes of Normandy and the Orkney Jarls,and Rollo's parentage is u
2 CONC nknown.
2 CONT
2 CONT Here are my notes on ROLLO, which I send in connection with a message sent
2 CONT by Stewart Baldwin in which he says he suspects I took my data from the
2 CONT "ridiculously unreliable Ancestral File" of the LDS.  As you can see, this
2 CONT isn't quite right.
