2 CONT
2 CONT General Notes: According to medieval historian, Snorii Sturluson, Olav's father, King Harald I (Haarfagre/Fairhair), bestowed the title of "King" to his sons and divided the land between them to rule.
2 CONT
2 CONT He was also called "Olav of Viken" and "Olaf Geirstatha-Alf." The name of his wife is unknown.
2 CONT
