1 NAME Grim "Shaggy Cheek"
2 GIVN Grim "Shaggy Cheek"
2 NICK Грим "Мохнатые Щеки"
1 NAME Grím Loðinkinna
2 GIVN Grím Loðinkinna
2 SURN
