2 CONT *Rollo (Hrolf the Ganger) Duke of Normandy born about 0846 Maer, Nord-Trondelag, Norway died about 0931 Notre Dame, Rouen, Nornandie, Neustria buried Notre Dame, Rouen, Nornandie, Neustria
2 CONT *Einar "Turf" Rognvaldsson Jarl of Orkney born about 0852 Maer, More og Romsdal, Norway died 0910 Orkney, Orkney Islands, Scotland
