2 CONT
2 CONT "67. OLAF HARALDSON BAPTIZED.
2 CONT
2 CONT Asta, the daughter of Gudbrand, soon after the fall of Harald Grenske married again a man who was called Sigurd Syr, who was a king in Ringerike. Sigurd was a son of Halfdan, and grandson of Sigurd Hrise, who was a son of Harald H
2 CONC arfager. ..."
2 CONT
2 CONT Det fortelles at han var gift med en datter til Nerid jarl. Dette kan ikke være riktig, da Nerid levde så tidlig som ved 800. Derimot kan hans hustru ha stammet fra ham.
