1 CONC eries of campaigns in Caithness, Sutherland, Ross, Moray, and a number of other regions, eventually receiving tribute from half of Scotland. However, the Scottish chieftains plotted against Thorstein, and he was killed; the exact 
1 CONC nature of his death is unknown but it probably took place around 880 or 890.
