1 CONT DATE 0911When Charles III the Simple King of France gave Ragnvaldsson Rollo, aka Rolf
1 CONT the Pirate Normandy, and made him Robert I Duke of Normandy to prevent him
1 CONT from attacking nearer to Paris, he threw his daughter Giesela into the deal.
